    {
      "section": "结构",
      "text": "- `package.json`：`dsh.bundle` manifest（市场收录的硬性要求）\n- `cordis.patch.yml`：bundle 层补丁（把插件实体挂进 profile）\n- `dsh/index.js`：服务端入口（arch-doc 同款技能根模式）\n- `skills/fact-gate/SKILL.md`：技能本体"
    },
    {
      "section": "装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin add github:43aquarius/luna-fact-gate"
    },
    {
      "section": "或 npm 源：pnpm add luna-fact-gate",
      "text": "```"
